# SSX (NPUB30892): fresh launch -> title -> dialogs -> Explore -> Start Run -> the chopper -> the drop.
# Every press waits for ITS screen (wait_screen on a recorded frame, ssx_ref/: the operator's two route
# presses recorded by route_rec.py on car8 2026-10-26, the preamble screens from the same day's runs) and
# fires the moment it is there -- no sleep past a screen's arrival (operator: "the menus hold things up").
# Thresholds: same screen across runs reads 1-2, the two dialogs read 7 against each other (so 5 there),
# the Explore globe rotates (26 against itself, so 32). Preconditions: the progressed save (the game
# resumes at EXPLORE > RANGE), Write Color Buffers OFF, fmv/ aside (Hunt_SSX_Mountain_20261026.md).
wait_screen ssx_ref/title.png 150 10
press_until start ssx_ref/autosave.png 30 6 5      # a dropped START is pressed again
press_until cross ssx_ref/online_dialog.png 150 20 5  # the loading screen, then the dialog
press cross 150
wait_screen ssx_ref/explore.png 60 32
snap r3_explore
press cross 243                # Start Run (the equipment card)
wait_screen ssx_ref/chopper.png 150 10
snap r4_chopper
press cross 232                # jump
sleep 8
snap r5_slope
